    {
      "number": 4,
      "id": "I_kwDONfywY88AAAABFoD2UA",
      "title": "Are we inline with the object security draft?",
      "url": "https://github.com/gloinul/draft-westerlund-moq-overview/issues/4",
      "state": "CLOSED",
      "author": "zaheduzzaman",
      "authorAssociation": "COLLABORATOR",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "https://github.com/gloinul/draft-westerlund-moq-overview/blob/c9f8857138fdfb5bd39c816b1cfd80b258644627/draft-westerlund-moq-overview.md?plain=1#L510-L514\n\nIn practice the non-modifiability depends on the mechanism being used for protection, hence we can say some properties are intended to remain unchanged across relays, subscribes need to verify such properties are not changed in transit. ",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-16T08:38:17Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-30T11:23:57Z",
      "closedAt": "2026-06-30T11:23:57Z",
      "comments": [
        {
          "author": "gloinul",
          "authorAssociation": "OWNER",
          "body": "Clarified that they can be E2E authenticated and thus verified to not have been changed. ",
          "createdAt": "2026-06-30T11:23:57Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-06-30T11:23:57Z"
        }
      ]
    },
